# Releases withdrawn after they were published. One entry per line:
#
#   vX.Y.Z YYYY-MM-DD reason
#
# A device that updates itself never moves to a retired tag, and one that runs a retired
# version moves to the best release that is not retired, even a lower one (docs/releasing.md,
# "Retiring a release"). A tag cannot be edited, so this file is how a release is taken back.
# It is read as words, never run: keep the three fields on one line and the reason short.
